        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="455.04" YPOS="1259.5968" OwnPage="1" ItemID="190370528" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="241.5842" HEIGHT="208.0512" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="8" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L241.584 0 L241.584 208.051 L0 208.051 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L241.584 0 L241.584 208.051 L0 208.051 L0 0 Z" gXpos="968.2256" gYpos="1816.14399999999" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" PSTYLE="Default Paragraph Style" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" LANGUAGE="en_US"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" FONTSIZE="9" CH="Gilgamesh Ichthyomorphosis"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" FONTSIZE="9" KERN="0" CH="Begging, pleading "/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para PARENT="Default Paragraph Style" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Writing emails is hard. Thankfully, Readme has a foolproof template to get out of any pesky final:"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Dear Professor [Name],"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    I am sorry to inform you that my [mother/brother/dad’s goldfish] has [died/disowned me/come out as gay]. I have been feeling particularly [distressed/euphoric/hungy] because of this news. I ask for your [support/understanding/bank account information] during this difficult time."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Because of this, my [doctor/therapist/uncle who thinks he is a doctor] recommends that I [don’t take this final/don’t give my presentation/receive an A in this course]. Thank you for understanding."/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="Best,"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="[Your name]  "/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="115.9624" YPOS="869.88615384615" OwnPage="1" ItemID="190381856" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="337.9256" HEIGHT="95.4898461538501" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L337.926 0 L337.926 95.4898 L0 95.4898 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L337.926 0 L337.926 95.4894 L0 95.4894 L0 0 Z" gXpos="115.9624" gYpos="1701.88615384615" gWidth="282.55" gHeight="45.4146798798563" ALIGN="1" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle ALIGN="1" LINESP="28" FONT="Special Elite Regular" FONTSIZE="33" SCALEH="90" KERN="-10"/>
                <ITEXT SCALEH="90" KERN="-10" CH="CMU Admin confused by controversy of new "/>
                <para LINESP="31"/>
                <ITEXT SCALEH="90" KERN="-10" CH="&quot;Youth in Asia&quot; initiative"/>
                <trail LINESP="31"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="118.3704" YPOS="970.504" OwnPage="1" ItemID="190384688" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="334.3656" HEIGHT="241.5008" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L334.366 0 L334.366 241.501 L0 241.501 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L334.366 0 L334.366 241.501 L0 241.501 L0 0 Z" gXpos="-38.2776000000001" gYpos="923.3798" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="John Autism"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" CH="Not an Asian Youth"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para ALIGN="0" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT CH="    After much deliberation, the CMU administration, including Farnam Jahanian and Gina Casalegno, have decided to bring more youth in Asia to the CMU campus. This has caused an outrage for many CMU students who believe that this is causing a “genocide” or “murdering students unnecessarily.” Although activism among CMU students is common, the fact surprising the administration so much is the lack of intelligence within the student body. Even though the words “youth,” “in,” and “Asia” are common words that any smart CMU student should know how to spell, most of the protestors misspelled the phrase as “euthanasia.” They carry posters with messages like “don’t allow euthanasia on campus” and “euthanasia ends lives.” "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Yesterday, President Jahanian issued a message to the student body:"/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Many of our students have expressed concern over the recent campaign to introduce youth in Asia to our campus. To those students who are protesting the campaign: we hear you. We understand your concerns. We will be creating a Youth in Asia Committee composed of ten students at CMU who will look into the pros and cons of introducing more youth in Asia to the university. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="However, we also think you’re really fuckin’ racist and should learn how to spell. Yes, I said the ‘fuck’ word. That’s fine, I’m an adult. I can say the fuck word."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Discourse on use of the ‘fuck’ word has swept our nation in recent years. People keep saying fuck, shit, ass, and piss, but some people are very weird as fuck and don’t like me using the fuck word, or Farnam. I don’t really particularly understand this. The fuck word is completely fine to use."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Anyway, Asian youth are being introduced to CMU."/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="118.656" YPOS="1217.664" OwnPage="1" ItemID="190379024" PTYPE="2" WIDTH="329.472" HEIGHT="247.68" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="0.3432" LOCALSCY="0.3432" LOCALX="-4.49883449883412" LOCALY="5.92074592074637" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="0" RATIO="1" Pagenumber="0" PFILE="New CMU ID (1).png" IRENDER="0" EMBEDDED="0" path="M0 0 L329.472 0 L329.472 247.68 L0 247.68 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L329.472 0 L329.472 247.68 L0 247.68 L0 0 Z" gXpos="118.656" gYpos="1217.664" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1"/>
    </DOCUMENT>
